== semantics ==
ok   non-blocking read of an empty pipe gives -EAGAIN
ok   write of 11 bytes into a 16-byte pipe
ok   a read returns what is there (11), not the 32 asked for
ok   non-blocking write into a full pipe stops at 16
ok   then -EAGAIN while it stays full
ok   no data and no writers: read returns 0 (end of file)
ok   write with no readers left gives -EPIPE
